# Soundy — Mobile-First Responsive Standards

## Breakpoint order (Tailwind v4 — mobile first)

```tsx
// ✅ Default = mobile, sm: = tablet (640px), lg: = desktop (1024px)
className="px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"
className="flex flex-col sm:flex-row"
className="text-sm sm:text-base"

// ❌ Never desktop-first
className="text-base sm:text-sm"   // wrong direction
```

## Viewport units — always dvh/dvw

```tsx
// ✅
className="min-h-dvh max-h-[90dvh]"
style={{ height: '100dvh' }}

// ❌
className="min-h-screen"   // use min-h-dvh
style={{ height: '100vh' }} // use dvh
```

## No fixed pixel widths that overflow on 390px

```tsx
// ✅ Responsive max-width
className="w-full max-w-md"
className="max-w-[min(100%,24rem)]"

// ❌ Hardcoded widths > 360px without overflow-x-auto parent
className="w-[600px]"
```

## Touch targets — minimum 44×44px

```tsx
// ✅ Small icon buttons need explicit touch area
className="w-11 h-11 flex items-center justify-center"   // 44px
// or use padding: px-3 py-2.5 min-h-[44px]

// ❌
className="w-6 h-6"   // 24px — too small without padding trick
```

## Modals — bottom-sheet on mobile, dialog on desktop

```tsx
// ✅
className="fixed inset-0 flex items-end sm:items-center justify-center"
// Panel:
className="w-full max-w-md max-h-[90dvh] rounded-t-2xl sm:rounded-2xl"

// ❌
className="fixed inset-0 flex items-center justify-center"   // centered-only = bad on mobile
```

## No horizontal overflow

Every scrollable row must have a bounded parent:
```tsx
// ✅
<div className="overflow-x-auto -mx-4 px-4">
  <div className="flex gap-3 w-max">...</div>
</div>

// ❌
<div className="flex gap-3">  {/* no overflow guard */}
  {items.map(i => <Card className="w-[300px]" />)}
</div>
```

## Safe area insets

```tsx
// ✅
className="pb-[env(safe-area-inset-bottom)]"
className="ms-safe-area-top"   // project helper class
```

## Testing targets

- 390px wide (iPhone 14) — primary target, no horizontal scroll
- 768px wide (iPad) — two-column layouts expected
- Admin panel features are **desktop-only by design** — acceptable

## ios/apptel/ mirrors app/ for mobile Capacitor overrides

Mobile-specific overrides go in `ios/apptel/src/` (Capacitor build). Shared fixes go in `app/src/`.
